<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK GROUP H1 PROFIT 245 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK GROUP H1 PROFIT 245 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank , Estonia's leading bank, said on Monday its consolidated group half-year profit was 245 million kroons, up 121.7 percent from the same period last year.  </p>
<p>In June it earned 30.5 million kroons in net profit compared to 43.1 million kroons in May after making loan loss provisions of 12.9 million kroons, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>The first-half result is equal to 76.6 percent of the forecast 320 million kroons for the total year.</p>
</text>
